%% Orchestrator pure-logic reconcile tick (every X seconds)
flowchart TD
  START([Tick start · project_id]) --> LOAD[Load config · capacity · policies]
  LOAD --> PLANS[Find PlanAccepted not fully materialized]
  PLANS --> MAT{New plan tasks?}
  MAT -->|yes| WRITE[Upsert board cards<br/>wire deps · external_ref]
  MAT -->|no| BOARD
  WRITE --> BOARD[Load board snapshot + worker sessions]

  BOARD --> DEPS[Mark Queued→Ready<br/>when dependencies done]
  DEPS --> CAP[Compute free slots<br/>max_agents − healthy workers]

  CAP --> SPAWN{Ready tasks and free slots?}
  SPAWN -->|yes| LIFE_SPAWN[Spawn workers · assign tasks]
  SPAWN -->|no| HB
  LIFE_SPAWN --> HB[Collect heartbeats]

  HB --> STUCK{Session stuck<br/>or over wall-clock?}
  STUCK -->|yes| KILL[Kill session · release claim]
  KILL --> RETRY{Retries left?}
  RETRY -->|yes| REQUEUE[Task → RetryWait → Ready]
  RETRY -->|no| FAIL[Task → DoneFailed]
  STUCK -->|no| PROG

  REQUEUE --> PROG
  FAIL --> PROG[Apply worker-reported status<br/>Blocked · Done* · progress %]

  PROG --> HITL{Newly blocked?}
  HITL -->|yes| NOTIFY[Notify project reviewers]
  HITL -->|no| EXT
  NOTIFY --> EXT[Map statuses to external board<br/>if project mapped]

  EXT --> RUN[Roll up task states → WorkRun]
  RUN --> TERM{Run terminal?}
  TERM -->|yes| CLOSE[CP10 RunTerminal · emit event]
  TERM -->|no| END
  CLOSE --> END([Tick end · sleep X s])
  END --> START
